type-systems-for-coding-agents

This repository contains a copy of toydb (https://github.com/erikgrinaker/toydb),
Copyright Erik Grinaker, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, at upstream
commit 2d7cd32 (toydb/rust). toydb's LICENSE is kept in every copy.

Changes and additions relative to upstream toydb, made for this experiment:
- toydb/python: a Python port of toydb, written to be structurally parallel to the Rust
  code and to pass the same golden scripts byte for byte.
- toydb/tiers/t1: the SQL core of both codebases, run in-process (server, client and
  Raft removed).
- toydb/tiers/t2: the full codebases, with a Python goldenscript runner and test cluster.
- toydb/tiers/t3: t2 plus four new extension layers (JSON output, statement digests, column
  statistics, export/import), including an AST change that keeps IS NOT.
- toydb/tiers/t4: t3 plus seven more extension layers (SQL formatter, views, result
  description, row estimates, prepared statements, statement lint, change log).
- check.sh, grade.py, LAYOUT.md and task directories in every tier; benchmark task specs
  under toydb/tasks.

Everything outside toydb/ (the harness, analysis and results) is original to this
repository.
